cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this project or its report, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Analysis and Design of a Smart Physical Retail Store Using the Dunnhumby Dataset"
abstract: >-
  Bachelor's final project in Computer Engineering at the University of Kashan.
  A Django and SQL Server decision-support system for a physical retail store,
  built on the Dunnhumby The Complete Journey dataset: association rules,
  repurchase prediction, product revenue forecasting, a business intelligence
  dashboard with statistical group comparisons, RFM segmentation, churn
  prediction, retention prioritisation and a hybrid product recommender.
